description:
Design a circuit that validates a combination of items based on specified criteria for total value, weight, and volume. The module takes in a set of input signals representing quantities of various items and computes the total value, total weight, and total volume using predefined multipliers for each item. It validates the combination by checking if the total value is at least 120, while the total weight and total volume do not exceed 60. The output indicates whether the item combination is valid based on these conditions.
module top_module(
    input A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J, K, L, M, N, O, P, Q,
    output valid
);

